# Nautilus Trusted Compute
# Copyright (C) 2026 Relational Network
#
# Docker ignore for the sgx-mvp build context.
#
# The build context is THIS directory (sgx-mvp/), not docker/. See
# docker/build.sh, which passes PROJECT_DIR as the context.
#
# RULE: only files that exist in the GitHub repo AND are required by the
# Dockerfile COPY instructions may enter the build context. Everything else is
# excluded here so that `docker build --no-cache` produces identical output
# regardless of local edits or leftover artefacts.
#
# The Dockerfile COPYs exactly:
#   rust-toolchain.toml  Cargo.toml  Cargo.lock  build.rs
#   .cargo/  src/
#   oracle-verify/  wasmi-impl/  python-rust-impl/  json-append/  github-download/
#   docker/sgx-mvp.manifest.template  docker/restart_aesm.sh  docker/start.sh
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Version-control internals ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore

# ── Build artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/target/
OUTPUT
result-*

# ── SGX artefacts (regenerated deterministically inside the container) ───────
*.sig
*.manifest
*.manifest.sgx

# ── Secrets / credentials (belt-and-braces; must never reach the context) ────
keys/
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*

# ── Runtime state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
data/
temp/

# ── Files present in the repo but NOT used by the Dockerfile ─────────────────
# Keeping these out ensures the build is unaffected by host-side tooling.

# Host-side build orchestration. docker build is invoked BY the Makefile, so
# including it would let a Makefile edit change MRENCLAVE.
Makefile
deploy.mk

# The pinned release contract, consulted by `make verify-mrenclave` and CI from
# the host — never COPY'd into the image.
measurements.toml

# Attestation test client (C sources + mbedtls tarball), not needed in the image
attest.c
attest
mbedtls/

# API collection, docs
postman/

# Root-level dev manifest template (production uses docker/sgx-mvp.manifest.template)
sgx-mvp.manifest.template

# Build-helper script (runs on the host, not inside the container)
docker/build.sh

# Local development image (built separately by docker-compose.dev.yml)
docker/Dockerfile.dev

# SPDX text is not required at runtime
LICENSE

# ── Documentation ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md
